To make payments of at least £50 a month or a single payment of at least £1,000 into your ISA Portfolio. You can make regular payments monthly, quarterly, half-yearly or annually for all investments other than the Insured Funds. There's no penalty for stopping or reducing your payments.
To expect to invest for five years or longer as stock market investments are medium to long term investments (although there is no minimum or maximum limit on the length of time you can invest).
