n The Fund is actively managed and the investment manager is not constrained by any  particular  asset  allocation  in  respect  of  geography,  industry  or  sector.  The collective  investment  schemes  in  which  the  Fund  invests  may  include  other schemes promoted by Columbia Threadneedle Investments. Typically, the Fund will  maintain,  in  normal  market  conditions,  an  exposure  to  equities  of  between 20% - 60% of the value of the portfolio, which in the investment manager's view, is consistent with the Fund's aim to maintain a cautious volatility level.
