#### How to compare
Method: RangeMatch
- Guard: Illustration growth rates are prescribed and differ between providers and between illustration dates; compare RIY only at the same growth basis.
- Guard: A critical yield quoted to a different retirement age is a different figure, not a contradiction.
- Guard: RIY expressed per year and total cost expressed in pounds describe the same thing differently; neither contradicts the other.
